<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Clube de Xadrez</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    header {
      background-color: #000;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero {
      background: url('https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Chess_board_opening_staunton.jpg/1280px-Chess_board_opening_staunton.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover;
      height: 400px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: white;
      font-size: 2rem;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section {
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #333;
    }

    .item {
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    .item img {
      width: 200px;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    footer {
      background-color: #222;
      color: #ccc;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Clube de Xadrez</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="hero">
    Bem-vindo ao nosso mundo de xadrez
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <div class="section">
      <h2>Sobre Nós</h2>
      <p>Somos um grupo apaixonado por xadrez, oferecendo torneios, aulas e desafios online.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Jogadas Famosas</h2>
      <div class="item">
        <strong>Ruy Lopez</strong><br />
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Spanish_Game%2C_C%C3%B3rdoba_Variation.svg/320px-Spanish_Game%2C_C%C3%B3rdoba_Variation.svg.png" alt="Ruy Lopez" />
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <strong>Gambito da Dama</strong><br />
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Queen%27s_Gambit_position.png/320px-Queen%27s_Gambit_position.png" alt="Gambito da Dama" />
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <strong>Mate do Pastor</strong><br />
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/FoolsMate.svg/320px-FoolsMate.svg.png" alt="Mate do Pastor" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Grandes Mestres</h2>
      <div class="item">
        <strong>Magnus Carlsen</strong><br />
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Magnus_Carlsen_2023.jpg/240px-Magnus_Carlsen_2023.jpg" alt="Magnus Carlsen" />
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <strong>Garry Kasparov</strong><br />
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Garry_Kasparov_4_December_2008.jpg/240px-Garry_Kasparov_4_December_2008.jpg" alt="Garry Kasparov" />
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <strong>Bobby Fischer</strong><br />
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Bobby_Fischer_1972.jpg/240px-Bobby_Fischer_1972.jpg" alt="Bobby Fischer" />
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <strong>Judit Polgár</strong><br />
        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/JuditPolgar10.jpg/240px-JuditPolgar10.jpg" alt="Judit Polgar" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Entre em contato</h2>
      <p>Email: contato@clubedexadrez.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2025 Clube de Xadrez - Todos os direitos reservados.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
